{"product":{"id":6236655255740,"title":"Cortech Cobra Mini Can Trash Receptacle - 710, 714","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eCortech Cobra Mini Can trash bins are virtually UNBREAKABLE and are the toughest trash receptacle available, making them ideal for continuous use in extreme environments. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRolled rim for extra strength and to secure liners\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRotationally molded structural polyethylene for maximum strength while maintaining flexibility\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo sizes:\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e710 - 10 quart\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e714 - 14 quart\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVirtually unbreakable and won't dent, rust or chip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlame Retardant (Passes Cal 133). Call for test results\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.20 Nominal wall thickness\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy to clean\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColors: \u003cspan\u003eAqua, Black, Blue Gray, Brown, Gray, Green, Indigo, Midnight Blue, Sand, Slate Blue, Stone Gray\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePacked in packs of 6 units, must buy full packs, price is per pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Cobra Mini Can passes the Cal 133 Burn Test, and is also available in a food grade material for general use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"\u003eAbout Cortech USA by Correctional Technologies:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eCortech USA (Correctional Technologies) manufactures products that are exceptionally durable, designed for use in compassionate and normative behavioral healthcare, corrections, law enforcement, heavy use commercial and industrial environments, parks and recreation, schools, universities, hospitals, emergency and homeless shelters, and other institutions and facilities where safety and durability matter. Cortech products are ideal for extreme us